<title>USA: Olympia SD 111, Wash., won by Key Capital.</title>
<headline>Olympia SD 111, Wash., won by Key Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Capital said it won $23 million of Olympia SD 111, Wash., general obligation bonds, 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.2932 percent.</p>
</text>
